    <string name="status_outbox_retention">Outbox keeps up to %1$d messages for %2$d days. Older or over-cap rows are parked (not deleted) so you can review them here. Bodies are stored in plaintext on device for now.</string>

    <string name="sms_rationale_title">Allow SMS access</string>
    <string name="sms_rationale_body">SMS Gateway reads incoming text messages on this phone so it can forward them to your gateway. It does not send SMS. Receive SMS is used for live delivery; Read SMS is used so the same messages can later be backfilled from the device inbox.</string>
    <string name="sms_rationale_not_requested">You will be asked to allow Receive SMS and Read SMS.</string>
    <string name="sms_rationale_denied">SMS access was denied. The app cannot queue incoming messages until both permissions are granted.</string>
    <string name="sms_rationale_permanently_denied">SMS access was denied and the system will not ask again. Grant Receive SMS and Read SMS in system settings, then return here.</string>
